    "title": "Hiring Production Engineer at ITC Limited Digital Technologies",
    "description": "ITC Limited Digital Technologies has an exciting opening for a Production Engineer at our Chandigarh office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout ITC Limited Digital Technologies:\nITC Limited Digital Technologies is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with ITC Limited Digital Technologies!",
